Value AGGREGATE_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value AGGREGATION_MODE (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value STATUS (\S+)
Value PRIORITY (\d+)
Value INDEX (\d+)
Value OPER_KEY (\d+)
Value FLAG (\{[A-Z]+\})

Start
  ^Aggregate Interface:\s+${AGGREGATE_INTERFACE}
  ^Aggregation Mode:\s+${AGGREGATION_MODE}
  ^\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${PRIORITY}\s+${INDEX}\s+${OPER_KEY}\s+${FLAG}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^Loadsharing Type:
  ^Management VLANs:
  ^Local:
  ^Remote:
  ^Port\s+Status
  ^Actor\s+Priority
  ^Flags:
  ^Role:
  ^-+
